{"id":"wb-5-297","name":"通济堰","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"通济堰","text":"通济堰位于中国浙江省丽水市莲都区碧湖镇堰头村，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n通济堰始建于南朝梁天监年间，由拱形溢流坝、通济闸、石函、渠道、叶穴、概闸、湖塘等组成。初建时为木坝，南宋开禧元年（1205年）改为石坝。现存拱坝长275米，底宽25米，顶宽0.2米，高2.5米，是世界上最早的拱坝。拱坝北端为通济闸，下游通过22.5千米长的干渠以及48条支渠、321条毛渠灌溉碧湖平原。通济闸旁有司马庙，现存历代碑刻十八通。在堰头村内临渠还建有文昌阁、石牌坊等清代建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%80%9A%E6%B5%8E%E5%A0%B0","revisionId":84932920,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84932920","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/764a8fe3117cd5d6350cfdc6.jpg","title":"通济堰3.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%80%9A%E6%B5%8E%E5%A0%B03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/%E9%80%9A%E6%B5%8E%E5%A0%B03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​丽水通济堰。","width":320,"height":213}}